<title>USA: Sparta Pharmaceutical Inc net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Sparta Pharmaceutical Inc net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.12     loss	 $0.56</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 1,187     loss	 3,650</p>
<p> Revs			   142			 19</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,768		    6,560</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net loss for the first quarter of 1996 included a charge of $3,062,913 for the acquisition of the assets and business of Lexin Pharmaceutical Corp in March 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues for the first quarter of 1997 increased primarily due to a higher level of interest income from the private placement of equity securities completed in 1996.</p>
</text>
